# LeakSanitizer suppressions (LSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=test/sanitizer_suppressions/lsan).
# Only allocations made by Berkeley DB 4.8 when its environment is opened:
# the library keeps them for the process lifetime. Seen with and without
# silent payments (control without NIP-047 identity, audit 2026-10-17).
leak:__os_malloc
leak:__os_calloc
leak:__os_realloc
leak:DbEnv::open
# CWallet::CreateWalletFromFile returns nullptr on init errors without freeing
# the instance (the node then stops); reached by pqwallet_guard_tests.
leak:CWallet::CreateWalletFromFile
